{"id": "60374", "title": "百兽之王", "author": "秦大人", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/60/60374.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／校园／一女多男／未定\r\n\r\n七岁那年老妈带我去庙里拜拜路过看相的摊位拉著我去算了一把，看相的说我一生的富贵命，一生无忧，“性”福美满。哄的老妈快笑成朵菊花。没有人注意到那看相的眼里一直闪烁诡异的精光 而我从头到尾只盯那摊位上的鸟。。。 \r\n\r\n一女N男，人兽，有爱，部分18禁。。。", "base": "files/article/html/60/60374", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "8858960.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-12", "file": "8858963.html", "available": false}, {"title": "13-21", "file": "8858965.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-28", "file": "8858966.html", "available": false}, {"title": "29-36", "file": "8858969.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-45", "file": "8858972.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-54", "file": "8858978.html", "available": false}, {"title": "55-58完结", "file": "8858980.html", "available": false}]}